WEBVTT

01:44.759 --> 01:45.560
Young man,

01:46.350 --> 01:47.789
I will pass on all my internal energy

01:47.789 --> 01:49.250
and martial skills to you.

01:49.870 --> 01:51.150
Kill him for me.

01:53.590 --> 01:54.190
Young man,

01:54.509 --> 01:56.150
I'll pass my powers to you too.

01:56.150 --> 01:58.640
Let's see which of us is more powerful.

01:59.000 --> 02:00.860
We'll also pass our powers to you.

02:25.280 --> 02:25.960
Seniors!

02:26.590 --> 02:27.190
Seniors!

02:28.400 --> 02:29.470
No, Seniors!

04:44.720 --> 04:45.360
Senior.

04:46.240 --> 04:46.680
Se…

04:47.070 --> 04:47.720
Young man.

04:48.560 --> 04:49.240
Senior.

04:49.950 --> 04:51.280
Hold on a little longer.

04:55.920 --> 04:57.120
I have heard

04:58.000 --> 05:02.360
about the youngest son of the Xiao family
and the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood.

05:03.240 --> 05:06.630
You were never meant for the Daoist path.

05:07.270 --> 05:12.270
But to save the Daxi martial world,

05:13.190 --> 05:15.360
to fight the Power Gang,

05:17.310 --> 05:22.240
no one but you can do it.

05:27.240 --> 05:28.630
Xiao Qiushui,

05:30.680 --> 05:33.159
have you remembered everything?

05:36.830 --> 05:37.560
I have.

05:39.430 --> 05:40.490
I'll never forget.

06:43.159 --> 06:44.070
Senior,

06:44.950 --> 06:47.190
is this your sword sheath?

06:48.190 --> 06:49.800
What if it is?

06:51.600 --> 06:52.870
The mark on it—

06:54.240 --> 06:55.480
was it left by you?

06:56.190 --> 06:57.870
You recognize this mark?

07:01.510 --> 07:02.720
Tell me now.

07:03.000 --> 07:06.120
Which sect does it belong to?

07:07.070 --> 07:07.830
Senior,

07:09.360 --> 07:10.480
if you don't know,

07:11.600 --> 07:12.950
where did you

07:14.120 --> 07:15.510
get this sheath?

07:16.560 --> 07:18.040
Half a month ago,

07:18.870 --> 07:20.400
an old friend's entire sect

07:20.480 --> 07:22.010
was brutally slaughtered.

07:22.750 --> 07:25.360
By the time I arrived, it was too late.

07:25.830 --> 07:30.000
My good friend died with hatred.

07:31.830 --> 07:35.390
With his last breath,
he said he found a traitor in his sect

07:35.560 --> 07:37.750
who colluded with outsiders.

07:38.430 --> 07:42.560
This mark was found
in their secret letters.

07:44.560 --> 07:46.600
Who could it be?

07:46.830 --> 07:49.000
Who could be so ruthless?

07:51.480 --> 07:52.600
I only know

07:54.360 --> 07:57.159
this is a secret group
hiding in the martial world,

07:59.720 --> 08:02.580
likely colluding
with the Northern Wastelanders.

08:05.600 --> 08:07.600
If I don't avenge my friend,

08:09.310 --> 08:12.630
I… I can never rest in pea…

08:28.040 --> 08:29.160
I never thought

08:30.800 --> 08:32.030
that before dying,

08:33.030 --> 08:34.870
I'd take on

08:36.630 --> 08:38.909
such a talented disciple.

08:54.960 --> 08:56.510
For decades,

08:57.480 --> 09:02.240
we've been at each other's throats,

09:09.320 --> 09:13.480
but now, we all share one disciple.

09:20.200 --> 09:22.720
You three have all died,

09:24.600 --> 09:27.320
leaving me alone in this world.

09:29.240 --> 09:30.510
I've long grown weary

09:31.670 --> 09:33.600
of living in this world.

09:40.000 --> 09:42.600
The road to the underworld beckons.

09:49.440 --> 09:51.910
How lonely.

11:04.750 --> 11:06.870
The eight seniors
came from different backgrounds,

11:06.870 --> 11:10.240
yet all devoted their lives
to martial arts.

11:11.120 --> 11:13.380
People say good and evil cannot coexist,

11:13.440 --> 11:16.320
but martial arts themselves
know no good or evil.

11:16.960 --> 11:18.620
Good people use them for good.

11:19.240 --> 11:21.500
It's evil thoughts that bring disaster.

11:22.390 --> 11:24.510
I hope in another world,

11:25.270 --> 11:27.720
you'll no longer be bound by factions

11:28.320 --> 11:29.510
and can fight freely

11:30.000 --> 11:32.330
for the joy of it without being disturbed.

11:32.750 --> 11:34.150
That must be delightful.

11:48.120 --> 11:49.850
The Eight Masters are all dead?

11:50.270 --> 11:51.600
What exactly happened?

12:20.750 --> 12:21.350
It's fine.

12:21.840 --> 12:23.080
Glorious even in defeat.

12:23.080 --> 12:25.120
I've defeated five challengers.

12:25.840 --> 12:27.700
I think here at the Golden Summit,

12:28.320 --> 12:29.870
none can rival me.

12:30.360 --> 12:32.600
Why don't you all just admit defeat?

12:36.440 --> 12:37.600
How arrogant!

12:46.080 --> 12:48.140
I'm Zhichen, leader of the Emei Sect.

12:48.200 --> 12:50.080
Show me what you've got.

13:02.600 --> 13:04.330
Abbess Zhichen is so powerful.

13:05.120 --> 13:08.030
So why has the Emei Sect
weakened over the years?

13:08.360 --> 13:10.270
It's said she suffers from an old illness.

13:10.270 --> 13:11.440
I'm afraid she's depleting

13:11.440 --> 13:13.500
her internal energy for this battle.

13:47.030 --> 13:47.840
Qiushui?

13:48.030 --> 13:50.090
Why does he look so much like Qiushui?

13:50.630 --> 13:51.910
Greetings, Chief.

14:16.150 --> 14:17.270
Li Chenzhou.

14:23.790 --> 14:24.790
Abbess Zhichen.

14:26.150 --> 14:27.360
Pardon the intrusion.

14:27.360 --> 14:29.630
How could two people look so much alike?

14:29.750 --> 14:30.480
Li Chenzhou!

14:31.080 --> 14:32.340
What are you trying to…

14:50.550 --> 14:51.950
The Tribulation Finger?

14:52.550 --> 14:54.480
You're so knowledgeable, Abbess.

14:54.550 --> 14:55.880
The Tribulation Finger

14:56.670 --> 14:58.670
can control one's vital meridians.

14:58.750 --> 15:01.550
If Chief wants you to live, you live.

15:02.510 --> 15:05.390
If he wants you to die, you die.

15:12.870 --> 15:13.510
Everyone.

15:17.320 --> 15:18.200
Have you all

15:18.870 --> 15:20.800
given up on the "Voidheart Codex"?

15:20.840 --> 15:22.300
If we all attack together,

15:22.630 --> 15:23.960
we might stand a chance.

15:41.150 --> 15:43.870
What I hold is the Infinite Pill.

15:44.600 --> 15:46.030
Whoever kills this fiend

15:46.550 --> 15:49.150
will get this priceless pill.

16:20.320 --> 16:23.030
You're under the control
of my Tribulation Finger

16:23.030 --> 16:25.910
only because your internal energy
is weaker than mine.

16:25.910 --> 16:27.440
With the Infinite Pill,

16:28.030 --> 16:29.490
you can break free from it.

16:31.960 --> 16:33.390
I'm curious to see

16:34.150 --> 16:37.080
if you'll risk your life to kill me

16:38.270 --> 16:41.000
or seize the Infinite Pill
to save your own lives.

16:49.600 --> 16:51.510
I haven't restored the Xiao family yet.

16:51.510 --> 16:53.640
I cannot be controlled by Li Chenzhou.

16:55.720 --> 16:56.910
Zhu the Great King.

17:02.670 --> 17:03.910
The Infinite Pill! The Infinite Pill!

17:03.910 --> 17:05.240
Over there! Over there!

17:09.160 --> 17:09.790
Qiushui!

17:09.880 --> 17:11.339
-It's mine!
-Give it to me.

17:12.750 --> 17:14.079
Yiren, don't be fooled.

17:14.510 --> 17:16.040
This Infinite Pill is fake.

17:16.510 --> 17:18.240
Shao Liulei poisoned it

17:18.240 --> 17:19.640
to get back at Zhu the Great King.

17:19.640 --> 17:20.569
What did you say?

17:23.069 --> 17:23.930
It's poisoned?

17:49.720 --> 17:51.960
You do look a bit like me.

17:54.590 --> 17:56.480
Th-They look so much alike.

17:57.030 --> 17:58.110
Almost identical.

17:58.480 --> 18:01.080
Shusui is much more handsome
than Li Chenzhou.

18:14.590 --> 18:15.920
So what if we look alike?

18:17.070 --> 18:18.830
I am nothing like you.

18:18.830 --> 18:20.680
Here it is. I found it.

18:20.830 --> 18:21.430
It's mine.

18:21.790 --> 18:22.400
Give it to me!

18:22.400 --> 18:23.030
It's mine!

18:23.920 --> 18:24.680
Give it to me.

18:24.680 --> 18:25.880
-Mine!
-Give it to me!

18:26.350 --> 18:27.160
Give it to me!

18:28.590 --> 18:29.880
Disgraceful!

18:31.680 --> 18:32.240
Move!

18:33.830 --> 18:34.690
It's poisoned!

18:34.830 --> 18:36.090
It really is poisoned.

18:36.350 --> 18:37.310
It's really poisonous. He's dead.

18:37.310 --> 18:38.440
He's dead. He's really dead.

18:38.440 --> 18:39.550
He's really dead. It's poisonous.

18:39.550 --> 18:40.880
It's really poisonous.

18:46.640 --> 18:49.440
Truth is less believable than lies,

18:50.510 --> 18:53.510
because truth is always harsher to hear.

18:54.550 --> 18:56.280
After fighting tooth and nail,

18:57.680 --> 18:59.110
this is the result.

19:00.160 --> 19:01.750
I gathered you all here

19:02.270 --> 19:04.270
to unite the masters of martial arts

19:04.440 --> 19:06.200
against the evil Power Gang.

19:06.960 --> 19:09.760
However, some people
got their priorities wrong,

19:09.880 --> 19:11.810
caring only for the Infinite Pill.

19:12.200 --> 19:13.680
What a disgrace.

19:15.160 --> 19:16.690
Where is Zhu the Great King?

19:18.350 --> 19:19.480
He fooled everyone!

19:23.350 --> 19:23.920
Qiushui,

19:25.000 --> 19:26.860
how did you know the pill was fake?

19:30.310 --> 19:34.110
Young Master Yiren, don't you know
what's happened to your brother?

19:34.640 --> 19:38.000
He's already taken the real Infinite Pill.

19:47.070 --> 19:48.200
The pill is gone.

19:48.640 --> 19:49.900
If you all want to live,

19:50.030 --> 19:51.550
there's only one way left.

19:53.720 --> 19:54.980
Everyone, be careful!

20:03.070 --> 20:06.310
The Tribulation Finger
is an extremely profound evil technique.

20:06.310 --> 20:08.310
We came here to rid the world of evil.

20:08.590 --> 20:10.190
How can we let him control us?

20:15.550 --> 20:16.640
How despicable.

20:18.270 --> 20:19.070
Xiao Qiushui,

20:20.440 --> 20:23.170
it's time you handed over
the Hero Command Token.

20:54.590 --> 20:55.510
Li Chenzhou!

20:56.480 --> 20:58.880
The Power Gang slaughtered
the Xiao family.

20:58.880 --> 20:59.550
Today,

21:00.350 --> 21:01.610
I'll avenge my parents

21:01.880 --> 21:04.720
and the 127 disciples of the Huanhua Sect!

21:31.350 --> 21:33.680
The Wudang Sect's Taiji Sword Technique!

21:41.680 --> 21:42.510
Nice moves,

21:43.440 --> 21:44.960
but not refined enough.

22:12.480 --> 22:14.280
The Shaolin Sect's techniques.

22:14.550 --> 22:18.280
How can Xiao Qiushui use both Shaolin
and Wudang's martial skills?

23:25.510 --> 23:25.960
Oh, no,

23:26.110 --> 23:26.880
is Qiushui planning

23:26.880 --> 23:28.920
to die together with Li Chenzhou?

23:56.880 --> 23:58.480
Chenzhou, it's cold
and damp on the mountain.

23:58.480 --> 23:59.540
Better put this on.

24:00.240 --> 24:01.300
Don't catch a cold.

24:09.110 --> 24:13.400
You're certainly one
of the most prominent young people

24:14.270 --> 24:16.000
in the martial world right now.

24:19.110 --> 24:22.310
I won't kill you today.

24:23.240 --> 24:24.700
If you don't kill me today,

24:25.880 --> 24:29.070
I'll kill you one day.

24:36.960 --> 24:37.640
Fine.

24:39.310 --> 24:40.510
I'll be waiting.

24:43.070 --> 24:46.270
What brought you
to the Emei Sect this time?

24:53.240 --> 24:56.270
I've always had only one purpose.

25:03.240 --> 25:06.030
Use this together
with the Hero Command Token.

26:16.750 --> 26:17.270
Look.

26:17.350 --> 26:18.080
What is this?

26:20.400 --> 26:21.530
It's a map, isn't it?

26:22.920 --> 26:23.750
What is this?

26:29.400 --> 26:30.160
It's a map?

26:36.270 --> 26:36.830
Yes.

26:37.590 --> 26:39.720
Years ago, the Northern Wastelanders

26:40.000 --> 26:42.130
marched south and seized the capital.

26:43.240 --> 26:46.830
They wanted to transport the treasure
and martial arts manuals back north,

26:46.830 --> 26:47.920
but on the way,

26:48.680 --> 26:51.160
they were intercepted
by General Wu's troops.

26:51.160 --> 26:52.240
During the chaos,

26:52.830 --> 26:55.360
the treasure was scattered
in Nantian Abyss.

26:57.400 --> 26:58.310
Nine years ago,

26:59.440 --> 27:02.110
Crazy Yan accidentally
entered Nantian Abyss.

27:02.960 --> 27:06.480
He found the treasure

27:07.240 --> 27:08.440
and hid it again.

27:09.480 --> 27:14.270
So he carved the treasure map
on the Hero Command Token.

27:21.830 --> 27:23.440
So Crazy Yan's original plan

27:24.110 --> 27:25.480
was to have Old Madam Wu

27:26.160 --> 27:28.160
reveal the location of the treasure

27:28.510 --> 27:29.510
to General Wu.

27:31.550 --> 27:32.350
That's right.

27:33.750 --> 27:35.310
Unfortunately,
this matter was too important

27:35.310 --> 27:36.570
to be spoken of openly.

27:37.310 --> 27:39.070
Some people with ulterior motives

27:39.070 --> 27:40.030
mistakenly believed the token

27:40.030 --> 27:42.160
was related to the "Voidheart Codex."

27:46.590 --> 27:47.240
Alright.

27:48.680 --> 27:50.410
Now that you all know the truth,

27:51.240 --> 27:53.680
come with me to find the treasure.

27:54.510 --> 27:55.840
If anyone is unwilling,

27:57.110 --> 27:59.040
just die here at the Golden Summit.

28:02.070 --> 28:02.680
Qiushui,

28:03.110 --> 28:05.640
it is a shame
that Daxi's treasure lies forgotten

28:05.640 --> 28:06.640
in the mountains.

28:07.270 --> 28:10.310
But we can't fully trust the Power Gang.

28:22.240 --> 28:25.110
I've freed most of the people here
from the Tribulation Finger.

28:25.110 --> 28:28.240
Those who are still under its control
are all useful.

28:29.160 --> 28:30.290
Three days from now,

28:31.310 --> 28:33.770
we'll meet at the entrance
of Nantian Abyss.

28:49.240 --> 28:51.370
I know you want
your parents' remains.

28:52.830 --> 28:55.750
Once this is done,
they'll be returned to you.

28:57.310 --> 28:58.370
And another thing—

28:58.790 --> 29:01.960
your parents weren't killed
by the Power Gang.

29:03.440 --> 29:04.480
Believe it or not,

29:05.440 --> 29:07.300
you'll find the answer yourself.

29:35.920 --> 29:37.640
Qiushui has brought honor
to the Huanhua Sect

29:37.640 --> 29:39.040
in front of all the sects.

29:39.270 --> 29:40.440
Too bad Kaiyan isn't here.

29:40.440 --> 29:42.310
Yiren is not happy to see this.

29:42.350 --> 29:42.920
Enough.

29:43.830 --> 29:47.270
If Kaiyan were here, he'd be controlled
by the Tribulation Finger too.

29:47.270 --> 29:50.160
Neither Yiren nor Kaiyan
is as good as Qiushui.

29:54.550 --> 29:55.070
Abbess.

29:58.200 --> 29:59.160
Li Chenzhou

30:00.480 --> 30:03.440
has actually got the Tribulation Finger.

30:04.640 --> 30:07.170
He could've wiped out
all martial arts sects.

30:10.550 --> 30:13.550
I've failed my seniors' expectations.

30:14.440 --> 30:16.040
I couldn't kill Li Chenzhou.

30:16.510 --> 30:17.790
You did well.

30:18.400 --> 30:20.880
You tried your best and saved all of us.

30:24.640 --> 30:27.720
I saw the martial skills you just used.

30:28.400 --> 30:30.310
Did you learn them
from the Eight Masters:

30:30.310 --> 30:31.480
Tieji, Yinping,

30:32.150 --> 30:33.350
Muye, Fanhua,

30:34.350 --> 30:35.880
the East-West Twin Swords,

30:36.510 --> 30:38.510
Suiyu, and Canjin?

30:39.070 --> 30:39.750
Yes.

30:42.270 --> 30:43.510
Those eight seniors

30:45.200 --> 30:46.130
have already...

30:48.400 --> 30:51.750
They passed all their powers to you.

30:52.550 --> 30:55.240
That means they truly trusted you.

31:00.750 --> 31:01.400
Abbess.

31:04.240 --> 31:04.920
Qiushui,

31:05.830 --> 31:09.240
the martial world needs someone new

31:10.070 --> 31:11.510
who has his own way

31:12.270 --> 31:15.400
to make everyone
believe in justice again.

31:18.000 --> 31:19.510
I'm already a cripple.

31:19.880 --> 31:22.790
From now on, it's all on you.

31:23.440 --> 31:23.970
Alright.

31:26.110 --> 31:26.750
Abbess,

31:27.480 --> 31:28.740
please don't say more.

31:29.920 --> 31:31.450
You'll definitely be fine.

31:33.830 --> 31:34.640
Please.

31:41.480 --> 31:42.110
Qiushui,

31:42.310 --> 31:45.000
are we really going
to Nantian Abyss in three days?

31:45.000 --> 31:46.510
We have no choice now.

31:47.070 --> 31:49.750
Many people are still controlled
by the Tribulation Finger.

31:49.750 --> 31:51.210
Besides, Li Chenzhou said

31:51.920 --> 31:54.240
he has my parents' remains.

31:54.920 --> 31:56.720
I have to go.

31:57.400 --> 31:58.130
Big Brother,

31:58.310 --> 31:59.770
do you really believe him—

31:59.830 --> 32:02.690
that your parents weren't killed
by the Power Gang?

32:08.240 --> 32:09.440
I don't trust anyone.

32:10.720 --> 32:11.510
I'll find

32:13.270 --> 32:14.590
the answer myself.

32:17.920 --> 32:18.750
Such a pity.

32:19.310 --> 32:20.070
Qiushui was so close

32:20.070 --> 32:21.730
to killing Li Chenzhou today.

32:25.270 --> 32:27.790
Actually, he had a chance to kill me.

32:28.790 --> 32:29.990
I originally thought

32:30.550 --> 32:33.110
Liu Suifeng pretended to be the lucky bag

32:34.480 --> 32:36.830
because he's R.

32:37.270 --> 32:38.000
R?

32:38.750 --> 32:40.950
But he's Li Chenzhou's right-hand man.

32:42.310 --> 32:43.920
Would he really act on his own?

32:43.920 --> 32:46.550
Could Li Chenzhou be R

32:47.070 --> 32:49.030
and order Liu Suifeng to do that?

32:49.880 --> 32:52.940
The Emei Sect gathered
all martial arts sects this time

32:53.070 --> 32:55.510
to discuss fighting
against the Power Gang,

32:55.510 --> 32:57.440
but someone with ulterior motives

32:57.720 --> 32:59.920
spread rumors that the "Voidheart Codex"

32:59.920 --> 33:01.780
was in Li Chenzhou's possession.

33:02.680 --> 33:04.140
His purpose for doing this

33:04.270 --> 33:07.110
must be to create chaos.

33:07.550 --> 33:08.550
You mean

33:09.640 --> 33:11.480
R wanted to use this opportunity

33:11.680 --> 33:13.740
to destroy the entire martial world?

33:14.400 --> 33:15.130
My goodness!

33:15.310 --> 33:16.040
Big Brother,

33:16.830 --> 33:18.360
what are you talking about?

33:19.240 --> 33:21.160
What does "R" mean?

33:23.790 --> 33:26.400
Sancai said the road ahead is long.

33:26.680 --> 33:29.000
I said we have to keep moving forward.

33:30.400 --> 33:31.960
We've always been on this road,

33:31.960 --> 33:32.620
haven't we?

33:34.680 --> 33:35.480
That's right.

33:36.440 --> 33:38.100
We've always been on the road.

33:40.110 --> 33:40.720
Let's go.

33:40.720 --> 33:41.270
Alright.

33:42.000 --> 33:42.790
Go, go, go!

33:43.960 --> 33:44.790
Go!

33:52.200 --> 33:55.000
Yiren, since you returned
from the Golden Summit,

33:55.510 --> 33:57.040
you've been in low spirits.

34:01.160 --> 34:02.510
I keep hearing rumors

34:04.070 --> 34:06.070
about Qiushui in the martial world.

34:06.750 --> 34:09.510
They say at the Golden Summit gathering,

34:10.590 --> 34:13.120
Qiushui had mastered
the "Voidheart Codex."

34:13.320 --> 34:14.480
Absurd.

34:15.630 --> 34:16.880
Complete nonsense!

34:17.400 --> 34:18.760
Yiren, don't be angry.

34:20.510 --> 34:22.400
Actually, Qiushui has always

34:22.960 --> 34:24.820
listened to you since childhood.

34:26.030 --> 34:28.960
Maybe he just hasn't had the opportunity.

34:30.030 --> 34:30.590
Yiren,

34:32.320 --> 34:34.580
the Xiao family is at a disadvantage now.

34:34.670 --> 34:37.030
Since Qiushui has made a name for himself,

34:37.760 --> 34:39.760
why not let him restore the family?

34:45.400 --> 34:47.030
He's so famous now.

34:47.510 --> 34:49.190
How could we possibly persuade him?

34:49.190 --> 34:51.590
Perhaps Qiushui has already been thinking

34:51.630 --> 34:53.630
of handing the Changge Sword to you,

34:54.360 --> 34:55.620
but he's just too proud

34:57.510 --> 34:58.630
to tell you.

35:05.280 --> 35:06.680
-Qiushui.
-Big Brother.

35:07.000 --> 35:07.730
You're back.

35:08.360 --> 35:09.690
Is everything alright?

35:10.360 --> 35:12.550
What about the task I gave you?

35:12.840 --> 35:14.030
While the Power Gang's elite forces

35:14.030 --> 35:15.110
were at the Golden Summit,

35:15.110 --> 35:17.150
we eliminated 12 of their small outposts
along the way.

35:17.150 --> 35:17.880
Twelve!

35:18.360 --> 35:19.070
Qiushui,

35:19.440 --> 35:21.070
everyone's heard
what you did at the Golden Summit.

35:21.070 --> 35:22.070
You were amazing.

35:22.960 --> 35:23.690
Big Brother,

35:23.920 --> 35:25.550
are you hiding something from us?

35:25.550 --> 35:27.000
The martial skills you used
at the Golden Summit

35:27.000 --> 35:29.200
weren't the Huanhua Sword Techniques.

35:29.760 --> 35:31.890
It's not that I meant to hide anything.

35:32.280 --> 35:35.670
It's just that what I went through
was too bizarre.

35:36.110 --> 35:37.280
Bizarre?

35:37.400 --> 35:38.130
Big Brother,

35:38.280 --> 35:39.140
what happened?

35:39.360 --> 35:40.440
Tell us about it.

35:40.630 --> 35:41.630
Yeah, tell us.

35:42.400 --> 35:42.920
Yeah.

35:46.480 --> 35:49.010
Do you remember
that day on the Golden Summit,

35:49.230 --> 35:51.670
when the Eight Masters fell off the cliff?

35:52.110 --> 35:53.370
When I went after them,

35:54.320 --> 35:56.920
I found
those martial arts fanatics sparring.

35:56.960 --> 35:57.710
By chance,

35:58.590 --> 36:00.710
they actually passed
all their internal energy

36:00.710 --> 36:02.800
and secret techniques to me.

36:04.630 --> 36:05.840
If that's the case,

36:05.840 --> 36:07.280
Big Brother, you now possess

36:07.280 --> 36:10.280
the skills of the eight greatest masters
of our time?

36:10.550 --> 36:11.350
That's right.

36:11.360 --> 36:11.960
Qiushui,

36:11.960 --> 36:14.230
you're getting more and more formidable.

36:14.230 --> 36:16.290
You truly look like a sect leader now.

36:17.480 --> 36:19.280
That's a bit of an exaggeration.

36:20.030 --> 36:20.630
Alright.

36:21.360 --> 36:22.360
Enough talk.

36:23.110 --> 36:25.230
Go back and rest.

36:25.670 --> 36:27.800
We have more important matters later.

36:28.030 --> 36:29.890
Big Brother, have a good rest too.

36:30.030 --> 36:31.070
Let's go.

36:31.070 --> 36:31.800
Let's go.

36:31.800 --> 36:32.330
Let's go.

36:33.550 --> 36:34.360
Keep up.

36:34.920 --> 36:35.510
Qiushui.

36:36.030 --> 36:36.560
Qiushui.

36:36.840 --> 36:37.590
You must be hungry.

36:37.590 --> 36:39.250
I'll get you something to eat.

36:39.400 --> 36:41.070
Fatty, where's the kitchen?

36:42.590 --> 36:44.050
I'm talking to you, Fatty.

36:51.630 --> 36:52.190
Qiushui.

36:58.000 --> 36:58.630
Yiren.

37:01.480 --> 37:02.410
Why are you here?

37:03.630 --> 37:04.190
What,

37:05.550 --> 37:07.110
since Xueyu's wedding,

37:08.000 --> 37:08.960
have you decided to never return

37:08.960 --> 37:10.290
to the Xiao Villa again?

37:16.800 --> 37:17.930
That's not the case.

37:21.510 --> 37:23.710
The Hero Command Token is so important,

37:23.710 --> 37:25.670
yet you didn't even mention it to me.

37:25.670 --> 37:27.000
If you ask if I blame you,

37:27.510 --> 37:28.480
of course I do.

37:32.190 --> 37:33.650
But it's understandable.

37:34.510 --> 37:35.910
Times are difficult now.

37:37.150 --> 37:38.280
And you've grown up.

37:39.030 --> 37:40.290
You have your own mind.

37:41.150 --> 37:42.010
That's normal.

37:47.510 --> 37:48.320
I came today

37:49.630 --> 37:52.230
hoping that the misunderstandings
between us

37:52.280 --> 37:53.410
could be cleared up.

37:56.190 --> 37:57.630
If you're free tonight,

37:58.440 --> 37:59.970
come to the villa for a talk.

38:02.030 --> 38:02.630
By the way,

38:03.280 --> 38:06.480
Kaiyan was too ill
to attend the Golden Summit gathering,

38:06.670 --> 38:08.070
and he's much better now.

38:09.320 --> 38:10.650
He also wants to see you.

38:12.280 --> 38:12.880
Alright.

38:14.920 --> 38:16.650
Faced with the powerful enemy,

38:17.190 --> 38:18.280
we brothers

38:19.760 --> 38:21.490
should indeed have a good talk.

38:23.550 --> 38:24.150
Yiren,

38:25.550 --> 38:27.280
I'll definitely come tonight.

38:50.630 --> 38:51.320
Yiren.

38:54.840 --> 38:55.480
Qiushui.

38:57.960 --> 38:59.020
Thank you, Kaiyan.

39:12.840 --> 39:13.550
This tea…

39:16.590 --> 39:19.250
It's made from bamboo leaves
from our backyard.

39:20.630 --> 39:22.560
It's been a long time since I had it.

39:26.110 --> 39:28.040
Yiren only brought a few leaves out

39:28.400 --> 39:30.130
and rarely makes tea with them.

39:30.550 --> 39:31.750
Now that you're here,

39:31.880 --> 39:34.010
he's prepared tea especially for you.

39:39.670 --> 39:40.320
By the way,

39:42.510 --> 39:44.840
when I was tidying
the villa the other day,

39:45.670 --> 39:47.930
I found some of Mother's old belongings.

39:48.880 --> 39:50.540
She embroidered this by hand.

39:51.190 --> 39:53.440
Inside is your favorite camellia.

40:38.630 --> 40:39.630
Thank you, Yiren.

40:42.510 --> 40:46.170
I know there have been
many misunderstandings between us lately,

40:46.550 --> 40:47.760
so I hope today

40:49.150 --> 40:50.360
we can speak openly

40:51.630 --> 40:52.710
as brothers.

40:56.920 --> 40:57.510
Yiren,

40:58.550 --> 41:00.080
that's exactly what I want.

41:02.440 --> 41:03.170
Let's drink.

41:04.000 --> 41:05.200
It's been a long time.

41:05.800 --> 41:06.530
Let's drink.

41:21.670 --> 41:22.930
Since that's the case,

41:24.230 --> 41:25.890
I want you to tell me honestly.

41:27.000 --> 41:29.800
Where did your internal energy
and martial skills

41:30.030 --> 41:31.230
really come from?

41:35.280 --> 41:36.940
That day at the Golden Summit,

41:37.550 --> 41:39.760
the Eight Masters passed them to me.

41:40.190 --> 41:41.250
The Eight Masters?

41:41.670 --> 41:42.280
Qiushui,

41:43.070 --> 41:44.730
you've never met them before.

41:44.920 --> 41:47.120
Why would they pass their powers to you?

41:47.590 --> 41:48.840
We're family.

41:49.800 --> 41:52.550
You can just tell us the truth.

41:56.230 --> 41:59.440
It indeed sounds bizarre.

42:00.030 --> 42:03.710
But there are people in this world
who just follow their hearts,

42:04.960 --> 42:06.630
doing things beyond reason.

42:07.590 --> 42:08.150
Yiren.

42:09.070 --> 42:09.710
Kaiyan.

42:10.400 --> 42:11.400
I wouldn't make up

42:12.320 --> 42:14.710
such a story to fool you.

42:15.550 --> 42:17.150
The situation is urgent now.

42:17.480 --> 42:19.080
So I'll be straightforward.

42:19.360 --> 42:19.960
Qiushui,

42:21.320 --> 42:23.110
did you secretly practice
the "Voidheart Codex"?
